window.products.push({"id":493044,"name":"U UQUI Preserved Real Rose with I Love You Heart Necklace 100 Languages, Birthday Gifts for Women Mom Her Girlfriend Wife Mothers Day Anniversary, For","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fwknkux5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【I Love You Gifts for Her】Forever flowers represent eternal true love. This rose is made of real fresh flower. It looks real and pretty. Would be a great gift on any special occasion. Perfect birthday gifts for women, mothers day gifts for mom, i love you gifts for her, gifts for girlfriend, gifts for wife. 【Love Express】In Paris, France, known as the \"capital of romance\", there is a love wall composed of 511 dark blue rectangular tiles with \"I love you\" written on them in 311 languages and handwriting. The design of love expression combined with our well-made 100 languages necklace can express love to our beloved all the time. It is a surprised and meaningful gift for your mother, wife, girlfriend, daughter, grandmother and so on. 【100% Real Preserved Rose】This preserved rose is made by processing nature flowers through a series of complex procedures. Easy to care : keep this preserved real rose in a cool place, without watering or sunlight, our rose can keep its appearance for 3-5 years. This eternal rose represents forever love, happy family, solid friendship. 【Package Include】A beautiful real rose + a love note card(You can write anything you want on this card) + a 100 languages I LOVE YOU necklace in the drawer, the drawer can also store rings or other jewelry. Beautiful Gifts on Mothers Day, Birthday, Anniversary, Thanksgiving Day, Christmas, Valentines Day etc. 【How to Project Necklace】We'd like to give one method on how to project 100 I Love You language to give her a surprise. Here is how. First, Turn on the camera on your Phone. Second, Put the LOVE STONE protruding side in back of your Phone camera. Finally, Then you will see the I Love You in 100 languages on your phone screen.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fwknkux5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"U UQUI","source_asin":"B093L7HBTF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-493044","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093L7HBTF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093L7HBTF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
