window.products.push({"id":493051,"name":"Slendor Chimney Sweep Kit, 33 Feet Chimney Cleaning Kit Chimney Cleaning Tool Chimney Brush with Button Locking System with 10 Nylon Flexible Rods for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qf5Rmbu9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍀The chimney sweep brush is made of reinforced nylon. It is very hard and has good flexibility and corrosion resistance. The chimney brush head has 30 nylon cords, divided into 6 parts, each 8 inches long. The chimney rod is also made of nylon, which has good elasticity. Each rod is 3.3 feet long, 0.5 inches in diameter. Use it to easily pass through small bends at 45 degrees or 90 degrees and clean any corner of the fireplace chimney 🍀The chimney cleaning kit set supports electric cleaning and manual cleaning. Before cleaning with the electric drill, you only need to install the accessory connected to the electric drill at the end of the pole. The chimney brush rotates at a high speed through the drill bit, which can effectively remove the dust and sediment in the flue or chimney, providing you with a clean and unobstructed chimney fireplace Flue. Make your cleaning endeavors something that is more easier 🍀The connecting lock of the buckle is made of stainless steel, which has very good fixability and can prevent breakage or loosening during cleaning. It is also very convenient when you are installing or disassembling. When installing, you only need to press the button and push in the connecting pipe to complete the installation. When disassembling, you only need to press down with an L- shaped wrench to pull out the disassembly 🍀The chimney brush kit with a very flexible brush head accessory, which can be easily rotated at a high speed with a drill bit. It can help you remove the dust and creosote accumulated inside the chimney and on the roof. After cleaning the chimney, the soot can be discharged more smoothly outside, and the most important thing is that it can prevent the fire caused by the flue and make the house safer. It can also help you save the professional service costs of the chimney cleaning 🍀Package includes: Nylon chimney sweep rods (according to the specifications you choose, each is 3.3 feet), 1 x hex bit adapter, 1 x hex key, 1 x plastic sheet, 1 x storage bag, 1 x English manual, a pair of gloves. The donated dust- proof gloves can better help you complete the cleaning task. It is recommended to measure the size of the drill bit before buying to avoid misfit. The hex bit adapter diameter size: 0.2 inches, it can be equipped with most of the bit cleaning tools on the market","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qf5Rmbu9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Slendor","source_asin":"B09RF7PGBS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-493051","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09RF7PGBS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09RF7PGBS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
