window.products.push({"id":493153,"name":"Juicer Machines, HOUSNAT Professional Celery Slow Masticating Juicer Extractor Easy to Clean, Cold Press Juicer with Quiet Motor and Reverse Function ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PMVMTPiEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【High Juice Yield & Upgrade Spiral System】:Slow masticating juicer with 7 spiral masticating can perfectly separate juice and pulp,extracting higher-purity juice and preserving higher nutritional value. Our auger spins at 80 RPM , extracts up to 20% more juice and 30% more vitamins and minerals. 80 rpm lower speed means no heat build-up and less oxidation. Such as extracting gingers, celery, wheat grass,oranges. 【Safe Small Caliber Cold Press Juicer】To ensures juicing process smoothly, we recommend that the size of ingredients should not exceed 3.93in.At the same time,allows you can remove the seeds when you cytting the fruit to reduce the bitter taste, can make the juice tastes better.Small feeder chute slow juicer can prevent children from bring injured during juicing.Humanized design can let you and your whole family make each other's favorite juice with fruit juicer together everyday. 【Food Grade Materials and Quiet Motor】Slow juicer operates at low speed silent DC motor equipped with intelligent protection chips, making it stop automatically for every 20 minutes' operation. 150W motor- less than 60 decibels, So it doesn't bother your neighbors and makes you feel comfortable when you juice. All detachable parts are made of high quality food grade antioxidant material, ensure you enjoy a quiet environment and healthy life when juicing. 【Easy to Disassemble & Clean】Juicer machine features a safety lock design, helps you easy to assemble and disassemble in minutes. Juice Extractor Machines has reverse function to avoid stuck and helps you to clean. All detachable parts are made of high quality Food Grade BPA-free anti-oxidation materials, easy cleaning with a bonus brush or can be safely cleaned in your dishwasher. 【Purchased with No Worries & Juicing Recipes】We provide 1-year free customer service, coverage on parts and performance, and lifelong technical support. Our package includes a delicious Recipe Guide for juicing beginners and juicing pros. please feel free to contact us if products have any problems. We specializes in providing buyers with high-quality kitchen appliance products and best user experiences.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PMVMTPiEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOUSNAT","source_asin":"B09SHJD4NG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-493153","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SHJD4NG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SHJD4NG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
