window.products.push({"id":493167,"name":"Bath Mat Rug 17\" x 24\" Non Slip Quick Dry Water Absorbent Bath Mat Simple Lines Print Bathroom Mats, Super Absorbent Bath Mat, Rubber Backed Thin Bath","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UaG2IMpaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Super Absorbent & Quick Dry Bath Mat】Crafted from premium soft diatomaceous earth,which can absorbs water on the soles of your feet and evaporates instantly to prevent water accumulation on the floor. Dry with your feet up. You will never take away a drop of water! 【Non-Slip Rubber Backed Bath Mat】Rubber backed bathroom rugs, made of upgraded and high density rubber sole. This shower rug has strong adsorption and grip to the ground, not easy to slide. Ideal for bathroom, sink, single or double vanity, beside your bathtub, and any other high traffic areas. 【Durable & No Shedding Material】This soft diatomaceous earth bath mat is more durable than traditional fiber bathmat. There will no microfiber flying in your home. And this new-tech soft diatomaceous bath mat will never shedding, fading and no bad smell. Bring you a healthier and easier life environment. 【Modern & Stylish Bathroom Decor】Modern geometric bath rugs,designed with simple regular symmetrical lines. Add an artistic and luxurious sense for your house. This contemporary style bathroom mat can easily be harmonious with your any home decoration. 【Machine Washable & Easy to Clean】Machine washable bathroom floor mat, which is easy to maintain. You can use a vacuum cleaner clean it if there exist a little dust. Rinse with shower nozlle or just wipe it clean is OK. Do not dry after rinsing, just air dry.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UaG2IMpaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MontVoo","source_asin":"B09ZDPV3BS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-493167","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZDPV3BS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZDPV3BS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":493168,"name":"Magnetic knife holder for wall no drill - 16\" Wooden knife magnetic strip no drilling option w/adhesive backing & drilling hardware | Magnetic knife s","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ReLnS35ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Superior Magnetic Power – This heavy duty magnetic knife block alternative is fitted with not 1 but 17 powerful magnets for end to end strength. The result? Whether you are looking to store a kitchen knife set, small knives or a large knife like a tough meat cleaver, this powerful kitchen knife magnetic holder knife stand can handle it all. Aesthetic Design – Unlike a regular metal knife magnetic strip, or other boring magnetic knife rack, This kitchen knife organizer has an aesthetic design that suits a variety of kitchen styles. It’s unique shape makes it look not just like a magnetic knife stand but more like a work of art hanging in your kitchen. Those with an eye for design will love its eye-catching, solid wood finish. Organize It All - This kitchen knife strip is far longer than your average knife stand. With its 16-inch long design, this extra-length magnetic strip for knives will allow you to aesthetically display all your knives as well as other stainless steel utensils on your wall, making it the ultimate magnetic spice rack kitchen organizer. Two Installation options – This magnetic strip for knives can be installed in 2 ways. either by using the included heavy duty double sided tapes or by drilling using included hardware. Using the no drill tape option makes it the perfect wooden magnetic knife holder for refrigerator, It also comes with both and installation template and an easy to follow instruction manual. That way, you can mount your magnetic knife block up on your wall or turn it into a magnetic knife holder for fridge. Keep your Knifes Sharp, and Safely out of reach of pets and kids– Storing your knives on a metal knife magnetic strip can dull your knives with time, and storing in a under cabinet knife storage pull down makes it a hazard. The solution is our heavy duty magnet knife display stand. Place the knife holder magnet somewhere easy for you but not so easy for kids or pet, thus keeping them sharp and accessible.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ReLnS35ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ROSHform","source_asin":"B0B7LWWV2Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-493168","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B7LWWV2Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B7LWWV2Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
