window.products.push({"id":493179,"name":"Trifo Robot Vacuum Cleaner, Robotic Vacuums 3000Pa, 110min Runtime & Self-Charging, Compatible with Alexa & Google Home & 2.4GHz WiFi, Ideal for Pet H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":129.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715XvTHpRKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Strong Suction and Pet Friendly】Designed for all pet owners, Trifo Emma can create an intense suction power of 3000Pa, which can easily loosen dust, crumbs, dander, and pet hair from any floor. With pets at home, Emma Pet Version is the perfect choice for you. 【Easy App Control】With Home App, home cleaning is just a breeze for you. You can easily create a cleaning schedule, control the suction power and cleaning direction by using the App. Only compatible with 2.4Ghz WiFi. 【Slim Body Design】The 3.34inch ultra-thin automatic vacuum cleaner can easily remove the hard-to-reach debris, dirt, and pet hairs hidden under beds and sofas higher than 3.8 inches correspondingly, which serves as a perfect assistant in your life. 【600ML Large Dustbin】Trifo robot vacuum cleaner Emma is equipped with a large capacity of 600ML dust box and a HEPA filter that can hold more debris, pet hair, and dust, saving your hands from tedious chores. 【Amazon Alexa & Google Assistant Enabled】Learn to keep your life listening to your voice. With Google Assistant and Amazon Alexa, you can start cleaning with just a voice command, such as \"Alexa, turn on Emma.\" 【High-Capacity Battery & Self-Charging】Equipped with a 2600mAh lithium battery, Emma allows a maximum run-time of 110 minutes after being fully charged. Besides, if the robot vacuum cleaner has finished its cleaning path or runs low during the cleaning session, it will automatically return to the charging station. 【Anti-Fall Sensors】Our robot vacuum is equipped with six anti-drop sensors, which can help Emma avoid falling from stairs or edges. Emma can also cross the obstacles under 0.8 inches. 【Schedule Cleaning】With Emma at home, you can control the robot vacuum cleaner remotely, set up its working hours, and arrange cleaning according to your schedule, thus greatly relieving your burden. 【What You Get】1 x Emma Robot Vacuum Cleaner, 1 x Power Adapter, 1 x Self-Charging Station, 1 x Roller Brush, 1 x Side Brush, 1 x HEPA Filter, 1 x User Manual, and our worry-free 12 months customer service. 【One Year Technical Support】We provide one year of free technical support for our customers. If you need any assistance with your product, please feel free to contact our customer service, and we will assist you in solving your problem within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715XvTHpRKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trifo","source_asin":"B0BRQBJSZT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-493179","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRQBJSZT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRQBJSZT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
