window.products.push({"id":493186,"name":"Classical Creations Vase with 12 Sunflowers by Van Gogh 6\" Silent Wall Clock (Includes Desk/Table Stand)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HhZxKYaNL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This is a beautiful wall clock depicting the famous painting Vase with 12 Sunflowers by Vincent van Gogh. It is approximately 6\" in diameter. This would make a great gift or personal item for the van Gogh aficionado or lover of classic artwork. About Our 6\" Wall Clocks Attractive and functional, our 6\" wall clocks feature beautiful photo-quality artwork and reliable USA-made clock motors. The 1/4\" thick wood base is a premium Certified Green Product that is durable and environmentally friendly. They come with both a durable metal hanger for wall mounting and an easel stand for display on a desk or table. (Use the stand to display a small plate or other decorative object if you don’t use it for the clock!) Their compact size and quiet operation makes them perfect for the smaller spaces in your house: bathrooms, kitchens, connecting walls—the possibilities are limitless. We are sure you will be proud to give our clocks as gifts or treasure them yourself for years to come. Our Classic Artwork Most \"fine art\" clocks are made by either cropping a circle in the center of the artwork discarding much of the original image, or shrinking the image down and adding plain borders to fill the extra space. We chose to do something different. Our graphic artists start with a high-resolution copy of the original image, and use state-of-the-art software to digitally \"mold\" the rectangular artwork on the face of a circular clock. Each image is meticulously edited, and care is taken to preserve the integrity of the original artwork while minimizing the distortion inherent in this type of image manipulation. We think you will agree that our clocks are more attractive and capture the look of the original artwork better than other similar offerings.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HhZxKYaNL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Classical Creations","source_asin":"B003M5GOAK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-493186","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003M5GOAK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003M5GOAK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
