window.products.push({"id":493328,"name":"Ambesonne Hamsa Bedrest with Back Pocket, Theme Hamsa Hands Geometric and Floral Pattern Evil Eye Protection, Pillow for Reading and Gaming Dorm Room ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jx+LfrCEL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Change your reading habits with Ambesonne reading pillow. Introduce comfort into your reading ritual and get the most of your concentration. Our products have been manufactured with high technology shredded Visco foam which gives its signature form and softness. The cover includes two specific elements that separate this from the rest. Handle and back pocket. The handle will help you with the portability of the product and the back pocket will give you so much freedom because you will have a place to put your stuff. There is an infinite number of thing you can use this product for. Reading, gaming, sitting on the floor or on the bed will change forever for you. This is the support pillow for the bed you wanted all those years. The covers also have a great variety of colorful designs you can choose from. These prints are made from harmless dyes for you your loved ones or your pets. These bed lounger pillows will be the best addition to your life. They will relieve you from the pain you feel at your back and spine. You will sit up in a more comfortable position thus you will get more done. We have a nice selection of sizes for all. If you are a small build person and you do not need a giant pillow you can have our standard size boyfriend pillow or if you prefer larger pillow for beds you can have our X-large bedrest. Our products are also really good for pregnant women or gamers. You can live in a large house or in a dorm this pillows will change your life. There is no better feeling than getting comfortable in your own space why not do it in style? Ambesonne foam reading pillows provide just that. These pillows make great presents. Gift them your family or friend, parents, grandparents, relative, boyfriend, girlfriend, or to yourself. The digital images we display have the most accurate color possible, however, due to differences in computer monitors, we cannot be responsible for variations in color between the actual product and your screen.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jx+LfrCEL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ambesonne","source_asin":"B07R723MFB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-493328","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07R723MFB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07R723MFB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":493329,"name":"Talisman Designs Butter Boy Butter Keeper & Spreader, Green","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51SnOYsqZ-L._AC_.jpg","description":"The Butter Boy from Talisman Designs is an innovative tool for every family who enjoys eating corn on the cob! He makes buttering corn-on-the-cob easy and fun, reduces waste and cuts down on messes. Just insert a half stick of butter, pop the top (his head), and start buttering. Take him to picnics, BBQs, or just have fun when eating corn at home. A great hostess and housewarming gift or give him to the person that already has everything! Store the butter Boy in the fridge standing upright. Made of BPA-free plastic. Easy care, dishwasher safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51SnOYsqZ-L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Talisman Designs","source_asin":"B09RQFYS33","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-493329","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09RQFYS33","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09RQFYS33","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
