window.products.push({"id":493503,"name":"iLuv Time Shaker Boom Wireless Vibrating Bed Shaker Alarm Clock for Heavy Deep Sleepers, LED Display, Loud Panic Alert, Flashing Red Alert Light, Mult","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51bHK2pXg+L._AC_.jpg","description":"WAKE UP TO VIBRATION FROM A UNIQUE WIRELESS BED SHAKER: Are you ready to start your day, the modern way? The TimeShaker Boom comes with a one-of-a-kind rechargeable wireless patented shaker that allows you to subtly wake up without disturbing your partner, roommate or significant other. Each shaker contain three different vibration levels - normal, strong and earthquake – so you can personalize just how strong you want your wake up alert to be! ULTRA STRENGTH CUSTOMIZABLE WAKE UP ALARM WITH PANIC SOUND: The TimeShaker Boom is the perfect companion to wake you up on time. This jumbo 1.4\" LED display clock has a built-in adjustable alarm tone that can reach as loud as 120 decibels -- the same volume as a hammer drill.Great for people who suffer from deaf, hearing loss, senior citizens, couples and heavy sleepers. ADD MORE TO YOUR WAKE UP WITH THE BUILT-IN ULTRA BRIGHT ALERT LIGHT AND JUMBO DISPLAY: The TimeShaker Boom has an additional backup alert option: three ultrasonic super glistening alert lights that flash when your alarm goes off. Feel free to customize your wake up experience to include any combination of light, sound and vibration for a whole new wake up experience unlike anything you've experienced. TAKE CHARGE WITH THE CONVENIENT BUILT-IN USB CHARGING PORT: Powering up just got more convenient with the TimeShaker Boom. The TimeShaker Boom contains a built-in USB port that allows you to charge the featured wireless patented bed shaker, or your smart phone or tablet (as well as most USB enabled devices) right at your bedside. ONE-STEP ALARM SETUP WITH DUAL ALARM OPTIONS: Extremely user friendly interface with easy-to-use control buttons that include a one-step alarm set up (once saved to main unit) and the ability to schedule multiple alarms at once. Great for those intimidated by complicated design and useful for couples and roommate on separate schedules.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51bHK2pXg+L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"iLuv","source_asin":"B079M755H9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-493503","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079M755H9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079M755H9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":493504,"name":"BambooMN 8\" x 8\" Organic Bamboo Decorative Display Table Top Tea Serving Tray Plate Holder for Coffee Dining Table, Countertop or Kitchen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-ZIn1QlrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ORGANIC TABLE TOP TEA TRAY 8\" x 8\" Elegant decorative bamboo display table top tea tray for serving 1-2 tea cups or snacks, 1 Piece TEA SERVER TRAY Use it to serve your tea, coffee, other drinks or serve any small snacks or appetizers STYLISH This tea serving tray will add a natural and stylish addition to any kitchen, coutertop, coffee or dining table 100% NATURAL BAMBOO Lightweight and Sturdy, Eco-Friendly, All Natural, No Chemicals Made from 100% Natural Bamboo CARE INSTRUCTIONS To get the most out of your bamboo tea serving tray, handwash only and dry immediately and thoroughly or wipe tray with damp cloth. We do not recommend putting bamboo flatware into the microwave as it will cause the bamboo to dry out and result in a cracked plate.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-ZIn1QlrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BambooMN","source_asin":"B07MLDS619","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-493504","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MLDS619","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MLDS619","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":493505,"name":"Jokari Healthy Steps Water Infuser, Single Unit, Colors Vary","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-Zx16skDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Most of us already know all the benefits of drinking water; it hydrates skin, aids in weight loss and helps to flush out toxins in the body. And, we're supposed to drink eight 8-ounce glasses a day. Why not make all 8 glasses taste fabulous and do something healthy at the same time? Jokari's Healthy Steps Water Infuser is just the thing to conveniently and economically add delicious natural fruit or herbal flavor to water or tea right at home. Simply place slices of fruit and/or herbs into the infuser; close the infuser and place it into a pitcher of water or tea for 30 minutes. The ingeniously designed ball keeps seeds, pulp and other ingredients contained and you'll get to enjoy a flavorful beverage that's actually good for you! Jokari's Water Infuser helps you to prepare healthy foods at home faster and easier; top rack dishwasher safe. For over 40 years, Jokari has held a special place in its heart for gadgets; today, they specialize in providing affordable solutions to common problems faced by consumers. From unique kitchen gadgets and household storage and organization solutions to their Healthy Steps kitchen tools designed to help with portion control and healthy eating, Jokari is committed to creating useful and often crazy looking \"thingamajigs\" that are fun, colorful and easy to use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-Zx16skDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jokari","source_asin":"B00INNY5BG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-493505","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00INNY5BG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00INNY5BG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":493506,"name":"HooTown 5 Sheets Wire Shelf Liners Fit Wire Shelving Size 48 Inch x 18 Inch, Clear Frosted Hard Plastic Protector Mats for Metal Stainless Steel Garag","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dhQrnFXAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅INNOVATIVE DESIGN AND EASY TO TRIM: HooTown Wire Shelf Liners 5 Sheets - Fit Wire Shelving Size 48\" x 18\" of SafeRacks, Meet Perfect, BestOffice. We have two design styles for you to choice, one has corner cut (the options with ”-Notched” at the end), the other has not. You can choose the right product according to your personal preferences. Our wire shelf liners with both designs are easy to trim with any household scissors. ✅MAKE YOUR WIRE SHELF PERFECT: As an upgrade to the Wire Shelf Liner Mats for Garage, Cabinets, Kitchen, Pantry Closet,Shoe Shelves can provide a flat surface to prevent small items from falling through or getting stuck between the wires. With this liner you don’t need to bother balancing objects on the wires to prevent them from falling over any more. So convenient and useful! ✅PREMIUM QUALITY AND SAFETY: Made of high quality material, the Clear Frosted Hard Plastic Shelving Mats for Metal Stainless Steel Rack is thick and strong enough for any heavy duty situation. You can put anything you want on this liner - as long as your shelf can hold it. As tested in our lab, this liner also has good penetration resistance by daily use. The PP plastic we use is without odor or BPA. So you do not have to concern about healthy when using this liner, even if you want to put your food directly on it! ✅WATERPROOF AND CHANGEBLE: Benefit from the premium material, this is a totally waterproof and washable wire shelf liners covers. Water or oil won’t leave any stain on its surface. So if your liner gets dirty you can freely wipe it with a wet rag or directly wash it under a faucet. In addition it also works well with common detergents. If you don’t like your liner any more you can remove it and change a new one as this liner is non-adhesive. ✅VERSATILE USAGE: Our wire shelf liners are designed with common sizes to fit standard wire racks. But they can not only be used in wire metal rack shelves, but also in all kinds of cabinet and shelves to prevent small items from falling over or to make your items look clean and tidy. With Hootown liners all of your shelves and cabinets are much easier to clean. So basically this liner can be used in any situation like in kitchen shelves, in garage, or in pantry etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dhQrnFXAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HooTown","source_asin":"B0BN3BGL2P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-493506","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BN3BGL2P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BN3BGL2P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
