window.products.push({"id":493621,"name":"Shabbat Candlesticks, Purple Candle Holders, Handmade Modern Judaica Table Centerpiece Decor Perfect as Wedding and Holidays Gift","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":85.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tE9CRvd2L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Traditional but modern looking gift.   These candle holders made of Nickel and decorated with polymer clay are an ideal present for any occasion, especially Wedding, Bat Mitzvah, housewarming and High holidays!  The flower patterns are thin slices from milliefiori canes I design and create from polymer clay. Think of it as very sophisticated sushi. what you see are slices of many canes combined. Flowers are in shades of crimson red black and pink.   Features:  Measures of each candlestick:  Height: 5\" ( 12.5 cm ) Diameter: 1.5-2.25\" ( 4-5.5 cm )  Materials:  * Polymer Clay, Nickel.  * Fits tall celebrative candles or Shabbat candles in traditional glass cups.  * The polymer clay is coated with a protective polish.  Cleaning:  * Clean with wet cloth, DO NOT put in dish washer.  Please note The flower patterns in actual product will Not necessarily be identical to those in photos since flower canes I use ( I use their slices) are handmade by me, I can never make two identical canes and so exact flowers might vary, I will always use the same color plate as in photos.  Add color to your life with Devarim Yafimo.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tE9CRvd2L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DevarimYafimo","source_asin":"B079M6PKFZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-493621","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079M6PKFZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079M6PKFZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
