window.products.push({"id":493748,"name":"LEAFICO Collapsible Metal Drinking Straw - Reusable Stainless Steel Straws - Portable Telescopic Straw with Case & Cleaning Brush - Foldable Straw for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71X+L5MTPOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Do you know that plastic straws are the seventh most collected waste item from beaches? Do you want to reduce your carbon footprint?🌎 Of course, you do. How? You can take a small step every time you enjoy a meal out be using LEAFICO metal drinking straws with your drink. Stainless steel straws are ideal for just about any occasion, in the car or restaurant, sleep over, BBQ, office, trip and more. Not only do they add to elegance to your dining room but are considerably more durable as compared to plastic straws. 💎There are many reasons why you should update to LEAFICO metal straws: ●FOOD GRADE STAINLESS STEEL  ●100% BPA FREE  ●NO METAL AFTERTASTE  ●UNBREAKABLE, LIFELONG USE  ●TELESCOPIC DESIGN, ADJUSTABLE LENGTH  ●PORTABLE CASE WITH A KEYCHAIN  ●SUITABLE FOR FAMILY PARTY, VISITING RESTAURANTS, OUTDOOR PICNICS, CRUISE TRIPS, OFFICE AND HOME USE  ●BIODEGRADABLE PACKAGING 🍹Enjoy Your Drink Longer: What’s worse than preparing a cold glass of smoothie on a hot summer day only for it to turn warm before you even enjoyed it? Steel retains the temperature of your drink and prevents it from melting down. LEAFICO steel drinking straws allow you to enjoy your drinks for longer periods of time. Product Details: 1 x Collapsible Metal Straw  1 x Portable Steel Travel Case  1 x Cleaning Brush  1 x Linen Pouch 🎁Forward-thinking Eco-Friendly Gift: Each of our actions can make a small difference. Metal straws with case is certainly forward-thinking Eco-Friendly Gift - not just that it has a great aesthetic value, it carries a meaningful purpose to us & the environment.  Just Click the “Add to Cart” button and enjoy the healthy life with metal collapsible straws whenever and wherever.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71X+L5MTPOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LEAFICO","source_asin":"B07TWPWLZZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-493748","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TWPWLZZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TWPWLZZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
