window.products.push({"id":493780,"name":"Shoes Box Storage Containers, S-JIANG Clear Sneaker Storage Box Side Open Door with Magnetic Stackable Display Case Shoe Organizer Box for Men Women W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ywmg+un3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Works Great on Size Up To Mens 14】Organizing is made convenient and simple with shoe organizer, the dimensions are around 14.2”L x 10.2”W x 8.7”H, allowing them to fit men’s shoes up to size 14 depending on their style. It is big enough to accommodate various types of shoes like sneakers, officials, and ballet flats. shoe box storage are also great for storing seasonable things, such as your winter shoes or summer sandals, so during the off-season they would not become a nuisance. 【Side Open Door Provides Rapid Access】Compared to other drop front shoe boxes, the side lid gives you easy access and you can take out your shoes without removing the box from the stack. It comes with a big air hole on the drop-front door which functions as a handle, so you can easily put your finger in it and pull down the door to open the box. The see-through front cover helps you to see what shoes you have available, so it easy for you to take out and put away shoes! 【Premium Quality Plastic, Ultra-clear Construction】In comparison to some other shoe display case, our shoe containers are using high quality clear plastic materials, which are more durable and make it easier to locate your sneaker with convenience.The magnetic door is easy opening and closing,so you can take out and put away shoes with ease and don’t have to unstack other box. The see-through design can boost visibility, saving you time when you are picking the right shoe for the day. 【Life Saver For Organizing Your Shoes】If you’re looking for stackable sneaker containers that looks great in entryway, bathroom, garage or living room, then try our side open shoes storage organizer. When you have this mens shoe organizer, you will not need to install any drawers or cabinets, and this gives you more freedom to organize your wardrobe or closet.You can also put your belts, books and anything you want to be organized in this storage shoe box. 【Easy to assemble, Satisfaction Guarantee】Unlike some of the other shoe containers, our clear sneaker box storage are easier to assemble. It can be fold into a box, but can also be unfolded and compressed to be put away when they are not storing footwear. The ventilation holes of the box allow air to flow throughout,preventing smells from lingering. We stand behind our products and want to ensure that you love them just as much as we do. If you have any problem, please feel free to contact us!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ywmg+un3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"S-JIANG","source_asin":"B08LKVRPT6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-493780","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LKVRPT6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LKVRPT6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
