window.products.push({"id":493783,"name":"RUGGABLE Noor Sapphire Washable Indoor/Outdoor Stain Resistant 5'x7' (60\"x84\") Area Rug 2pc Set (Cover and Pad)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91oh10J9giL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"RUGGABLE is the 2-Piece decorative rug and flooring solution of the future!  Protect your floors from spills, skids, and scratches with one removable Rug Cover and one cushioned non-slip Rug Pad. This innovative technology makes it possible for small and large area rugs to be washed as easily and frequently as bedding, leaving your entire living space looking, smelling, and feeling clean!  With RUGGABLE, rug cleaning is easy as 1... 2... 3. Removable, Washable, Reusable! CARE INSTRUCTIONS: Simply remove your Ruggable Cover from the Rug Pad. Simply remove your Ruggable Cover from the Rug Pad. Machine Wash the RUGGABLE Cover in COLD WATER and Dry on MEDIUM HEAT in any conventional washer and dryer. Machine Wash the RUGGABLE Cover in COLD WATER and Dry on MEDIUM HEAT in any conventional washer and dryer. Spot clean Rug Pad as needed. Spot clean Rug Pad as needed. RUGGABLE uses patented Cling Effect technology to keep the cover attached to the rug pad. The underside of the cover grips to the top surface of the rug pad, similar to hook-and-loop fasteners. RUGGABLE uses patented Cling Effect technology to keep the cover attached to the rug pad. The underside of the cover grips to the top surface of the rug pad, similar to hook-and-loop fasteners. *** DO NOT wash in HOT Water or dry using HOT Heat. It will cause the corners to curl up. *** All rug sizes are approximate. Due to the difference of monitor colors, some rug colors may vary slightly. We try to represent all rug colors accurately. Please refer to the text above for a description of the colors shown in the photo.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91oh10J9giL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RUGGABLE","source_asin":"B072BSM2BP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-493783","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B072BSM2BP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B072BSM2BP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
