window.products.push({"id":493791,"name":"Brown Pillar Candle - Rustic Finish - Sandalwood Scent - Best Gift","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71X9KgOQXhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"High quality, low smoke and drip free fragranced pillar candles with a popular rustic appearance and solid colour all the way through. They have bright flames, easy to relight wicks and are very popular due to their long burning times. This successful range combines simple shapes with modern textures. A stylish decoration perfect for creating warm and inviting atmosphere in every interior. Also available in many colours and scents allowing for different combinations. Burn just one or several candles at once to vary the intensity of the fragrance.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71X9KgOQXhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Higlow","source_asin":"B00SF0MKXW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-493791","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00SF0MKXW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00SF0MKXW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
