window.products.push({"id":493795,"name":"Ignis Products CTF-001 Lia Tabletop Ventless Ethanol Fireplace Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51-JPugNfBL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"Don't let the lack of space hold you back from enjoying the warmth and ambiance of a fireplace - grab this Lia Black Tabletop Ceramic Ventless Ethanol Fireplace instead. This open-flame fireplace is one of the smallest fireplaces on the market and is truly one of a kind. This unique design is specially crafted to fit on your table top so that you can get the benefits of a fireplace without needing to install a chimney, run lines, or fool with the mess created by a traditional fireplace unit. It has a 1.5-liter ethanol insert and throws 6,000 BTUs of heat, so it will keep you and guests snuggly warm for up to five hours between refills. Dimensions: 12.5\" x 6.25\" x 4\". FEATURES: Tabletop, Freestanding - can be placed anywhere in your home (indoors & outdoors) Tabletop, Freestanding - can be placed anywhere in your home (indoors & outdoors) Ventless - no chimney, no gas or electric lines required Ventless - no chimney, no gas or electric lines required Easy or no maintenance required Easy or no maintenance required Capacity: 1.5 Liter Capacity: 1.5 Liter Approximate burn time - 5 - 9 hours per refill Approximate burn time - 5 - 9 hours per refill Approximate BTU output - 6000 Approximate BTU output - 6000 Dimensions: 12.5\" x 6.25\" x 4\" Dimensions: 12.5\" x 6.25\" x 4\" Product Weight: 8 Pounds Product Weight: 8 Pounds DOWNLOADS: VIDEO: RECOMMENDED FUEL: Ethanol fuel burns cleanly and does not produce the soot, smoke, or mess that is normally associated with a wood-burning fireplace. This ethanol fireplace fuel is made from 100% alcohol without the use of any oil at all. Ethanol is produced from renewable agriculture products, like barley, grains, sunflowers, corn, wheat, and potatoes, and manufactured in an earth-friendly process that does not harm the environment.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51-JPugNfBL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IGNIS","source_asin":"B00MYFPMY8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-493795","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00MYFPMY8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00MYFPMY8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":493796,"name":"SONGMICS Shoe Boxes, Set of 18 Shoe Storage Organizers, Stackable and Foldable for Sneakers, Fit up to US Size 8.5, Black ULSP006H18","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IZgDSklJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Kick Mess to the Curb: If your home is slowly but surely becoming a mess of shoes, why not organize them in this pack of 18 classic shoe boxes with black body and transparent front door? See your whole collection in order Keep It Clear: You don’t have to take out and dig through your shoe boxes to look for your commuting shoes every morning, the transparent front door gives you a glimpse inside your tower of kicks with grab-and-dash ease A Snap to Set Up: Simply slot the front, back, and body together and you’ll have these shoe organizers with an inner size of 11.8”L x 8.9”W x 5.3”H for max. US size 8.5; each pair of sneakers, heels, or flats will have a place of its own Stack up, and Presto: If you want to store the boxes in an organized way, the corresponding slot design on the top and bottom makes stacking them a snap; ventilation holes let your shoes breathe What You Get: Pack of 18 black shoe boxes with clear front door, stackable and foldable design, ventilation holes. Say goodbye to scattered shoes everywhere and put your shoes in order now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IZgDSklJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SONGMICS","source_asin":"B08PY29277","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-493796","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08PY29277","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08PY29277","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":493797,"name":"TOPWCK Sturdy Large Fun Ceramic Japanese Hand Drawing Anime Cute Bunny and Flora Microwavable Ramen Noodle Bowl with Lid and Handle Set with Chopstick","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710+IqG1ZjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍜CUTE DESIGN: The very traditional Japanese style hand-drawing bunny and flora design is so cute and eye-catching, would be adored among kids, teens or adults, and the elders for sure! 🍜MULTIPLE ACCESSERIES: As it can be a perfect container for cereal, soup, ramen, salad, yougurt or any snacks you like, we think it would be a nice pal for your entertainment time. So we arranged a fingerchopstick (check it, very hot!), a portable phone holder, and a pair of sakura pattern chopsticks with a pouch (same pattern as the chopsticks!), all in one set included! 🍜RIGHT SIZE FOR RAMEN LOVERS: around 4.5-inch height and 5.9-inch width, this 34 oz large bowl is made of safe and high-quality ceramic, which is sturdy and big enough for 1-2 packs of instant noodles, and even has more room for any extra dressings you like. The ceramics lid can avoid spilling, can trap the heat, and the handle makes it easy to hold. 🍜MICROWAVE & DISHWASHER SAFE: If you are a college student or people who don’t like kitchen stuff, this bowl is microwavable, dishwasher safe, oven safe, and very easy to clean. Just put some water and instant noodle in the bowl and put it in the microwave oven, then a quick meal is ready. 🍜FREE RETURN POLICY: If any broken, please contact customer service and we will arrange a replacement ASAP. Feel free to order and enjoy your meal!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710+IqG1ZjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TOPWCK","source_asin":"B0BBQW43S3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-493797","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BBQW43S3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BBQW43S3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
