window.products.push({"id":493852,"name":"Rajasthan Block Print Paisley Tapestry Cotton Spread 104\" x 70\" Twin Green","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BCSGNY6cL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"BLOCK PRINT RAJASTHAN TWIN TAPESTRY ~ Gorgeous block print paisley, Rajasthan tapestry in beautiful soft shades of green and touches of yellow with beige background. Made of 100% power-loomed cotton offering a strong, tight, durable weave. Measures approximately 104 X 70 inches. They can be machine washed separately on cool/gentle and tumble dried. Rajasthan is the most colorful state in India and it is reflected in it's forms of textiles. The tradition of printing with finely engraved wooden blocks distinguishes it from other states. The block printed textiles of India became famous in the 16th and 17th centuries in Europe when the East India Company began to export them in bulk. The block prints are mostly executed on a white or off white background, using screen printers or wooden blocks. They are usually colorful floral patterns and known for their fine and intricate detailing. The block print designs created centuries ago remain ever popular through out many cultures around the world today. A lovely quality with endless versatility. Your Block Print tapestry can be used for: ~FURNITURE COVER~BEDSPREADTABLECLOTH~BEACH BLANKET~ ~ROOM DIVIDER~A GREAT AFFORDABLE GIFTHANG THEM ON YOUR WALL OR CEILING~! We hope to inspire your imagination & creativity~:-)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BCSGNY6cL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Homestead","source_asin":"B002F8PQO0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-493852","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002F8PQO0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002F8PQO0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
